// HZM coop - AUDIO ENHANCEMENT SUITE aliases (any ubersound/*.scr is auto-registered).
//
// DISTANT WEAPON TAILS: layered by cgame (cg_parsemsg.cpp CG_MakeBulletTracerInternal) at the
// shooter's muzzle when a bullet volley originates > coop_distantFireDist units from the listener.
// Generous min/max distances so the tail carries across the map (the cgame already gates by range).
aliascache coop_gun_tail_rifle sound/coop_distant/tail_rifle.wav soundparms 0.9 0.1 0.95 0.1 1200 8000 auto loaded maps "m e t dm obj train"
aliascache coop_gun_tail_auto sound/coop_distant/tail_auto.wav soundparms 0.9 0.1 0.95 0.1 1200 8000 auto loaded maps "m e t dm obj train"
//
// AMBIENCE BEDS: levelwide loopsounds driven by coop_mod/ambience.scr (volume re-issued ~2s to
// track the combat-mix duck). Distances are moot for levelwide loops but kept sane as a fallback.
aliascache coop_amb_wind sound/coop_amb/amb_wind_loop.wav soundparms 1.0 0.0 1.0 0.0 160 1600 auto loaded maps "m e t dm obj train"
aliascache coop_amb_country sound/coop_amb/amb_country_loop.wav soundparms 1.0 0.0 1.0 0.0 160 1600 auto loaded maps "m e t dm obj train"
//
// DISTANT ARTILLERY sweeteners: reuse the stock Omaha lead-in barrage explosions (Pak3) at low
// volume with a huge radius; ambience.scr plays one on a far-offset emitter every 20-60s of calm.
// Numbered aliases + script randomint pick (the proven deathvox pattern).
aliascache coop_amb_artillery1 sound/coop_amb/artillery1.wav soundparms 0.5 0.1 0.85 0.15 2000 20000 auto loaded maps "m e t dm obj train"
aliascache coop_amb_artillery2 sound/coop_amb/artillery2.wav soundparms 0.5 0.1 0.85 0.15 2000 20000 auto loaded maps "m e t dm obj train"
aliascache coop_amb_artillery3 sound/coop_amb/artillery3.wav soundparms 0.5 0.1 0.85 0.15 2000 20000 auto loaded maps "m e t dm obj train"
aliascache coop_amb_artillery4 sound/coop_amb/artillery4.wav soundparms 0.5 0.1 0.85 0.15 2000 20000 auto loaded maps "m e t dm obj train"

